---
title: "The Smith Manoeuvre in Practice and the 65% HELOC Limit"
description: "The Smith Manoeuvre turns mortgage debt into potentially tax-deductible investment debt over time. Here's how it works and how the 65% HELOC limit affects it."
publishDate: 2026-11-18
